"""Easy-Print frontend installer (Milestone 7: student portal, print-station kiosk, admin console).

HOW TO USE
  1. Save this file in your project folder: the folder that CONTAINS the "backend" folder.
  2. Open a terminal there and run:   python update_frontend.py
  3. It writes the "frontend" folder (backing up anything it replaces), then offers to run "npm install".

Then, in two terminals:
  backend:   cd backend  ->  python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
  frontend:  cd frontend ->  npm run dev      (opens on http://localhost:5173)

Pages: / (students)   /admin (admin)   /kiosk (print station)
It never touches your "backend" folder or your data.
"""
